<title>UK: Estee Lauder prices share offering.</title>
<headline>Estee Lauder prices share offering.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estee Lauder Cos Inc of America has priced an offering of 7.215 million shares of class A common stock at $47.0 per share, lead manager Goldman Sachs said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The total offering has been increased from 5.665 million shares with 1.443 million share being offered internationally.</p>
<p>All shares are being offered by Ronald S. Lauder and Leonard A. Lauder. The offering is co-led by Dillon, Read &amp; Co Inc, Merrill Lynch and J.P. Morgan.</p>
<p>The shares last traded at $47.375 per share.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7970</p>
